{
  "_meta": {
    "scenario": "kerbalism-processes",
    "notes": "The same Kerbalism-style stack, but as a LIVE Kerbalism frame: the Domain is present and each converter carries the Uplink's own extension namespace (processToken, title, broken). That is what lets the Kerbalism Uplink contribute its per-process filter axis to resource-ops.filters, so this fixture renders the widget with BOTH the built-in by-resource axis and a provider-contributed one, plus the Broken facet a failed process earns. The widget itself is unchanged and still knows none of it."
  },
